  ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  -- C12_KANTO (106 steps)
  -- note: ROUTE (from presets/C12_KANTO_notes.md): Surge, Sabrina, Power Plant
  -- chain + Misty, Rock Tunnel, Lavender EXPN card, Routes 12-15, Janine,
  -- Route 7 Snorlax, Erika, Vermilion Snorlax, Diglett's Cave, Brock,
  -- Viridian/Pallet/Cinnabar, Route 20, Blaine, Blue at Cinnabar, Blue in
  -- Viridian.
  -- note: NO FLY: every 'fly to X' of the notes is walked/surfed. Extra
  -- walking legs checked with the earlier trace's path tool (sight lines,
  -- ledges, surf): Power Plant -> Cerulean, Cape -> Route 24 bridge ->
  -- Cerulean, Cerulean -> Power Plant (2nd), Fuchsia -> Route 7, Celadon ->
  -- Vermilion, Seafoam -> Cinnabar, Cinnabar -> Viridian. Only one new forced
  -- trainer: Schoolboy Sherman on Route 1 northbound
