  -- Vermilion -> Route 6 -> Saffron on purpose, because Lavender -> Route 8
  -- forces Gentleman Milton and Bikers Harris and Zeke (appear after Lavender)
  -- plus the two Route 8 cut trees. The 'go VERMILION_CITY' waypoint keeps the
  -- robot off Route 8.
  -- note: SURF on Route 12 South (both ways) is needed to avoid Couple Vic &
  -- Tara and Fisher Barney, matching the earlier trace (only Joshua and Kenny
  -- forced).
  -- note: GYM TRAINERS: the earlier trace did not trace gyms (leaders set all
  -- gym-trainer flags). Battle steps were added where the on-foot path to the
  -- leader cannot avoid a sight line: Vermilion (Horton, or Janet), Cerulean
  -- (Briana or Viola, and Diana), Celadon (Twins, Tanya or Michelle, Julia and
  -- Dahlia), Pewter (Edwin), Seafoam (all six). They change no net flag.
  -- Saffron (all spinners), Fuchsia (talk-only trainers) and Viridian (spin
  -- maze, simulated) have none. The Vermilion trash-can switches are random
  -- and may need more gym battles.
  -- note: POKE FLUTE: no item; both big Snorlax check the Poke Flute radio
  -- channel (SpecialSnorlaxAwake, wMapMusic == MUSIC_POKE_FLUTE_CHANNEL). The
  -- 'use' steps name it POKE_FLUTE_RADIO with radio_knob 78
  -- (wRadioTuningKnob).
  -- note: NET CHECK vs story_presets.lua C12: all
